{"id":"Wb48bda76bb2d518c0c152eeb","zh":"极值Ⅱ型分布","en":"","name":"极值Ⅱ型分布","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb48bda76bb2d518c0c152eeb","text":"极值Ⅱ型分布","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S39a7928249265bbcb198","source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明: 青藏铁路轨道不平顺不同波长下的谱密度值均服从广义极值II型分布(Frechet 分布) ; 轨道高低和轨向不平顺谱线呈现复杂的窄带和周期波谱特征,其轨距不平顺状态基本处于德国高干扰谱和美国六级谱之间,应该作为重点关注的不平顺类型; 结合不同波长谱密度的概率分布规律,建议在统计平均值谱的基础上,融合尖峰谱线特征,以便提供更为合理的动力仿真激励输入谱。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2c940f7425891c537e9c","source_id":"P106","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"profile vertical and alignment irregularities 从图2 可知,不同波长谱密度广义极值分布的形状参数ξ >0,表明服从广义极值II型分布 (Frechet 分布) 。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"广义极值分布形状参数为正时的类型，作者据此描述所分析谱密度样本。","language":"zh","source_id":"P106","paper_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wdfca3b196d2ff8ff799328ad","name":"Frechet distribution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wdfca3b196d2ff8ff799328ad","name":"Frechet distribution","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_langua